            "review_title": "Review at Saigon Halal Food Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Rose H\nSingapore, Singapore58 contributions\n0\nVisit only if there is no choice\nDec 2019\nMalaysian-owned restaurant which serves halal singaporean, malaysian and vietnamese cuisines. The server does not take the order correctly not just for my table but also the table of another family. Food is not so great but it is as expensive as other halal restaurants around Ho Chi Minh. Our table has a baby cockroach crawling around. Disappointing!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 30, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
