            "review_text": "El J\nDa Nang, Vietnam43 contributions\n0\nFriendly staffs and Halal Foods\nDec 2015 • Friends\nI visited this restaurant 2 times, the first comment is about foods, for me one of the best one for Halal foods in HCMC. located close to the Mosque, and many people normally many people having meals during lunch time.\n\nA lot of variety of the foods, some foods are from few countries of south Asian countries.\n\nWhen my wallet was left the staff reminded me, that was very nice and happy to see the honesty of the staff.\n\nIf I do not wrong, I ordered beef Curry and local sauteed vegetable and my friend ordered Mie Goreng. he said delicious and look also in good plating presentation.\n\nSome staffs are speak Malay even though not really fluent, but happy to hear...:)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 27, 2016",
